OL,3,GNEWSADriver dies in single-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash in village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has died in a single-vehicle
OL,7,Fcrash in a village in West Sussex,
OL,8,Fpolice say.
OL,10,FThe crash, which involved a silver Audi
OL,11,FA6 Avant, happened at about 06:40 GMT
OL,12,Fon Tuesday on the A286 in West Dean
OL,13,Fnear Chichester, Sussex Police said.
OL,15,FThe driver, a 37-year-old man from
OL,16,FChichester, died at the scene.
OL,18,FOfficers are investing the
OL,19,Fcircumstances of the crash and anyone
OL,20,Fwith information is asked to contact
OL,21,FSussex Police.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
